<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46923" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŭper-vŏlo</span></b> ,
			āre, v. a. and n.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to fly
			over</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">totum supervolat orbem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. M.
					4, 624</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">supervolantes alte alites,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 14, 14, § 36</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mel. 1, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Val. Max. 4,
				8, 5</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tremebunda supervolat hasta,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 10, 522</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
